         "text": [
            {
               "text": "#### General Rules\n\nThe tables of 2 and 4 are close relatives: 4 × N = 2 × (2 × N). For example, 4 × 3 = 12 and 2 × 6 = 12: three groups of four are exactly the same as six groups of two. The equalities go up to 40: 2 × 20 = 4 × 10.\n\nSelect an equality on the left and then its result on the right. Match every pair to complete the level and move on to the next one!",
               "source": [],
               "date_time": null,
               "isTable": false,
               "imgdesc": "",
               "format": "markdown",
               "PostMention": ""
            }
         ],
